WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.788
YouTube Ad Punisher

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:03.156
Auto-reloads YouTube

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:03.887
pages when an

00:00:03.699 --> 00:00:04.630
ad plays

00:00:05.166 --> 00:00:06.180
A small tool

00:00:05.991 --> 00:00:07.123
that automatically

00:00:06.935 --> 00:00:08.066
reloads a YouTube

00:00:07.878 --> 00:00:09.045
page whenever an

00:00:08.857 --> 00:00:10.012
ad starts playing

00:00:10.201 --> 00:00:11.628
so playback resumes

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:12.441
without sitting through

00:00:12.253 --> 00:00:12.878
the ad

00:00:13.414 --> 00:00:14.935
YouTube re-evaluates

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:15.619
ad serving on

00:00:15.442 --> 00:00:16.326
each reload

00:00:16.527 --> 00:00:17.906
after 1-2 cycles

00:00:17.718 --> 00:00:18.590
the ad slot

00:00:18.508 --> 00:00:19.546
is empty and

00:00:19.369 --> 00:00:20.347
the video plays

00:00:20.159 --> 00:00:20.760
clean

00:00:21.278 --> 00:00:22.315
Auto escape

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:23.789
after 3 reloads

00:00:23.884 --> 00:00:25.464
the extension automatically

00:00:25.276 --> 00:00:26.230
switches to a

00:00:26.042 --> 00:00:27.138
helper tab for

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:27.928
4 seconds

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:29.391
then switches back

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:30.924
Full story on

00:00:30.735 --> 00:00:31.631
the dashboard
